=== PARITY (vs web features/system/components/state-machine/StateTimeline.tsx) ===
  Data sources (web → native): useTranslation → FSMStateTimelineLocalizer (P1/S10);
    useDateFormat().formatTime + formatRelative → injected DateFormatters + the ported
    relative buckets. The component owns no data hook (web parity: pure presentational);
    the parent windows the shared P1/S8 transition buffer into FSMStateTimelineData.
  Composition reproduced 1:1:
    bordered box · axis header (formatTime(start) · "Window: {{minutes}} min" · formatTime(end)) ·
    h-10 track with a center rule + one dot per in-window transition placed by leftPct, colored by
    getStateColor(fsmType, to_state).dot, selectable (ring on select), Tooltip "{from} → {to} · {time}" ·
    empty branch: "No transitions in window" (+ " · Last transition {{rel}}" when a last transition
    exists) with the "Widen window to {{label}}" (primary) + "Jump to last transition" (ghost) controls
    gated exactly as the web (showWiden = widerPreset && onWidenWindow; showJump = lastTransition && onJumpToLast).
  Verbatim web logic ported + unit-pinned: windowTransitions (in/out split + most-recent), nextWiderPreset
    (smallest preset > current that fits the gap; nil > 24h / negative), the useMemo placement math
    (span guard, sort, leftPct), presetLabel (<60 "{n} min" / <1440 "{round(n/60)} h" / "24 h"),
    formatRelative ("just now"/"{m}m ago"/"{h}h ago"/"{d}d ago"/date).
  States (all render, never a blank box): loading (skeleton) · empty ("no transitions") · error(+retry) ·
    loaded→timeline OR in-window empty hint · stale (banner + one-shot auto-refresh) · offline (cached
    timeline + banner). ADR-013 freshness envelope.
  i18n: every web key resolves through the P1/S10 facade; the catalog carries the verbatim web English
    (debugger.window.minutes/hours/day, debugger.timeline.empty/lastSeen/widenTo/jumpToLast/windowLabel/
    tickAria). a11y: VoiceOver label + value on every tick, region label on the track, combined labels
    on the axis/empty/banner; Dynamic Type via Font.TS ramp; reduce-motion-safe selection animation.
  Telemetry: emits view.opened with surface slug "StateTimeline" once (P1/S11), asserted by test.

